# Modus Icons - Essential Rules

## ✅ ALWAYS Use This Pattern

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Icon with text (left)
<i className="modus-icons mr-2">save_disk</i>
Save File

// ✅ CORRECT - Icon with text (right)
Next
<i className="modus-icons ml-2">arrow_right</i>

// ✅ CORRECT - Icon only
<i className="modus-icons">settings</i>
```

## 🎯 Required Setup

**CSS Import Order** (in `globals.css`):

```css
@import url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@trimble-oss/modus-icons@1.17.0/dist/field-systems/fonts/modus-icons.css");
@import "tailwindcss";
```

## 🎯 Icon Names

Use exact icon names from [Modus Icons Catalog](https://modus-icons.trimble.com/field-systems/):

- `save_disk`, `download`, `upload`
- `edit_combination`, `delete`, `settings`
- `arrow_right`, `arrow_left`, `expand_more`
- `check`, `close`, `add`, `remove`

## ❌ NEVER Use

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Missing class
<i>save_disk</i>

// ❌ WRONG - Wrong class name
<i className="modus-icon">save_disk</i>

// ❌ WRONG - Non-Modus icons
<i className="fa fa-save"></i>
```

## 🎯 Key Rules

- **Always** use `modus-icons` class
- **Use Tailwind spacing**: `mr-2`, `ml-2` (not inline styles)
- **Icon placement**: Left = `mr-2`, Right = `ml-2`, Only = no spacing

